---
import { Header, Footer } from '../App.jsx';
import { salon } from '../content.js';
import { brandHead } from '../../scripts/seo.mjs';
import '../booking.css';
import '../order.css';
const fields = [
  { name: 'name', label: 'Nama', type: 'text', autocomplete: 'name', max: 80 },
  { name: 'whatsapp', label: 'Nomor WhatsApp', type: 'tel', autocomplete: 'tel', hint: 'Gunakan nomor Indonesia saat konsultasi, misalnya 081234567890. Bisa diawali 08, 628, atau +628.', max: 40 },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffd2e6" />
    <title>Booking setelah konsultasi | Chii Nails Palembang</title>
    <Fragment set:html={brandHead(salon.name)} />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/cormorant-garamond-latin-500.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/dm-sans-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Lewati ke formulir</a>
    <Header />
    <main id="main" class="booking-page container">
      <div class="booking-intro">
        <a class="text-link booking-back" href="/">← Kembali ke Chii Nails</a>
        <h1>Siapkan nail date-mu.</h1>
        <p>Sudah konsultasi dengan Chii? Isi detail sesuai kesepakatan, lalu kirim ringkasannya melalui WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="booking-preview-note"><strong id="booking-mode-title">Booking setelah konsultasi</strong><p id="booking-mode-description">Nama, nomor WhatsApp, harga total, tanggal, dan jam wajib diisi. Pilih DP atau full payment sesuai kesepakatan.</p></div>
      <div class="booking-layout">
        <section aria-labelledby="booking-form-title">
          <h2 id="booking-form-title" tabindex="-1">Detail booking</h2>
          <noscript><p class="booking-noscript">Aktifkan JavaScript untuk mengisi formulir, atau <a class="text-link" href={salon.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">hubungi Chii melalui WhatsApp</a>.</p></noscript>
          <p id="booking-calculator-note" class="booking-calculator-note" hidden></p>
          <form id="booking-form" action="/book" method="post" novalidate data-whatsapp={salon.whatsapp}>
            <div class="booking-draft-note">
              <p>Isian dan bukti pembayaran dapat dipulihkan di tab browser ini hingga 24 jam jika penyimpanan tersedia, termasuk setelah koneksi terputus atau halaman dimuat ulang. Hapus isian setelah memakai perangkat bersama. Browser dapat menghapus simpanan ini lebih awal.</p>
              <p id="booking-draft-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Belum ada isian tersimpan.</p>
              <div class="booking-draft-action"><button id="booking-draft-clear" class="booking-status-retry text-link" type="button" hidden>Hapus isian tersimpan</button></div>
            </div>
            <div id="booking-errors" class="booking-error-summary" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden><strong>Periksa detail berikut.</strong><ul></ul></div>
            <fieldset disabled><legend>Kode dari Chii</legend><div class="booking-field"><label for="booking-code">Kode booking</label><input id="booking-code" name="bookingCode" type="password" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="characters" required aria-describedby="booking-code-hint" /><small id="booking-code-hint">Minta kode dari Chii setelah konsultasi. Kode hanya berlaku untuk nomor WhatsApp yang Chii daftarkan dan dapat digunakan kembali. Isian dipulihkan setelah muat ulang, tetapi kode perlu dimasukkan lagi. Mengirim permintaan belum mengunci jadwal.</small></div></fieldset>
            <fieldset disabled>
              <legend>Data diri</legend>
              {fields.map(field => <div class="booking-field">
                <label for={`booking-${field.name}`}>{field.label}</label>
                <input id={`booking-${field.name}`} name={field.name} type={field.type} autocomplete={field.autocomplete} maxlength={field.max} required aria-describedby={`${field.hint ? `hint-${field.name} ` : ''}error-${field.name}`} />
                {field.hint && <small id={`hint-${field.name}`}>{field.hint}</small>}
                <p id={`error-${field.name}`} class="booking-field-error" hidden></p>
              </div>)}
              <div class="booking-field order-lookup" data-order-lookup>
                <label for="booking-order-code">Kode kalkulator (opsional)</label>
                <div class="order-lookup-row"><input id="booking-order-code" data-order-input type="text" maxlength="5" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="characters" aria-describedby="booking-order-hint" /><button type="button" class="button button-secondary">Lihat rincian</button></div>
                <small id="booking-order-hint">Tempel kode pilihan 5 karakter untuk memuat rincian. Boleh kosong; ini bukan kode akses booking dari Chii.</small>
                <p data-order-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="order-detail" data-order-detail hidden></p>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
            <fieldset disabled>
              <legend>Nominal sesuai konsultasi</legend>
              <p class="booking-fieldset-hint">Isi harga total dan nominal DP yang kamu bayar dalam Rupiah tanpa titik atau koma. Minimum DP Rp20.000, atau pilih full payment.</p>
              <div class="booking-field booking-payment-choice"><label for="booking-paymentMode">Pilihan pembayaran</label><select id="booking-paymentMode" name="paymentMode" required aria-describedby="hint-paymentMode error-paymentMode"><option value="deposit" selected>DP · min. Rp20.000</option><option value="full">Full payment · Lunas</option></select><small id="hint-paymentMode">Nominal pembayaran tidak melebihi harga total. Harga Rp20.000 atau kurang dibayar penuh.</small><p id="error-paymentMode" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p></div>
              <div class="booking-amounts">
                <div class="booking-field"><label for="booking-agreedPrice">Harga total</label><div class="booking-currency"><span aria-hidden="true">Rp</span><input id="booking-agreedPrice" name="agreedPrice" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="8" required aria-describedby="error-agreedPrice" /></div><p id="error-agreedPrice" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p></div>
                <div class="booking-field"><label id="booking-payment-amount-label" for="booking-deposit">DP · min. Rp20.000</label><div class="booking-currency"><span aria-hidden="true">Rp</span><input id="booking-deposit" name="deposit" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="8" required aria-describedby="hint-deposit error-deposit" /></div><small id="hint-deposit">Isi nominal DP yang kamu bayar, minimum Rp20.000 dan tidak melebihi harga total. Tanpa titik atau koma.</small><p id="error-deposit" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p></div>
              </div>
              <div class="booking-payment-routes" aria-label="Tujuan pembayaran">
                <p class="booking-payment-heading">Tujuan pembayaran</p>
                <div class="booking-payment-route"><div><strong>ShopeePay</strong><span id="booking-shopeepay-number" class="booking-account-number">083843639096</span><small>Hermadewi</small></div><button type="button" data-copy-payment="booking-shopeepay-number" data-payment-label="ShopeePay" aria-label="Salin nomor ShopeePay">Salin</button></div>
                <div class="booking-payment-route"><div><strong>blu · BCA Digital</strong><span id="booking-blu-number" class="booking-account-number">002409374146</span><small>Jesica R.</small></div><button type="button" data-copy-payment="booking-blu-number" data-payment-label="rekening blu" aria-label="Salin nomor rekening blu">Salin</button></div>
                <p id="booking-copy-status" class="booking-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
            <fieldset disabled>
              <legend>Desain & jadwal</legend>
              <p class="booking-fieldset-hint">Pilih layanan dan durasi sesuai konsultasi dengan Chii. Semua waktu menggunakan WIB.</p>
              <div class="booking-field booking-design-options">
                <label for="booking-serviceDuration">Layanan & durasi</label>
                <select id="booking-serviceDuration" name="serviceDuration" required aria-describedby="hint-serviceDuration error-serviceDuration">
                  <option value="plain:60">Plain · 1 jam</option>
                  <option value="gel:60">Gel · 1 jam</option>
                  <option value="removal:60">Removal · 1 jam</option>
                  <option value="simple:60">Simple Design · 1 jam</option>
                  <option value="simple:120" selected>Simple Design · 2 jam</option>
                  <option value="full-art:180">Full Art · 3 jam</option>
                  <option value="full-art:240">Full Art · 4 jam</option>
                  <option value="full-art:300">Full Art · 5 jam</option>
                </select>
                <small id="hint-serviceDuration">Pilih durasi yang sudah disepakati. Pilihan ini menentukan waktu, bukan harga layanan.</small>
                <p id="error-serviceDuration" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p>
              </div>
              <div class="booking-field">
                <label id="booking-date-label" for="booking-date">Tanggal</label>
                <div class="booking-date-control">
                <input id="booking-date" name="date" type="date" required aria-describedby="error-date" />
                <div id="booking-calendar" class="booking-calendar" role="group" aria-labelledby="booking-date-label" aria-describedby="booking-calendar-help error-date" hidden>
                  <div class="booking-calendar-header">
                    <button type="button" data-calendar-previous aria-label="Bulan sebelumnya"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m14 6-6 6 6 6" /></svg></button>
                    <strong id="booking-calendar-month" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></strong>
                    <button type="button" data-calendar-next aria-label="Bulan berikutnya"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 6 6 6-6 6" /></svg></button>
                  </div>
                  <table role="grid" aria-labelledby="booking-calendar-month" aria-describedby="booking-calendar-keys">
                    <thead><tr>{[['Sen', 'Senin'], ['Sel', 'Selasa'], ['Rab', 'Rabu'], ['Kam', 'Kamis'], ['Jum', 'Jumat'], ['Sab', 'Sabtu'], ['Min', 'Minggu']].map(([short, full]) => <th scope="col" aria-label={full}>{short}</th>)}</tr></thead>
                    <tbody></tbody>
                  </table>
                  <p class="booking-calendar-selection" data-calendar-selection role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Belum ada tanggal dipilih.</p>
                  <p id="booking-calendar-keys" class="sr-only">Gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah hari, Home atau End untuk awal atau akhir minggu, dan Page Up atau Page Down untuk berpindah bulan. Tekan Enter atau Spasi untuk memilih.</p>
                </div>
                </div>
                <p id="booking-calendar-status" class="booking-slot-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Memeriksa jadwal bulan ini…</p>
                <button id="booking-calendar-retry" class="booking-status-retry text-link" type="button" hidden>Periksa tanggal lagi</button>
                <small id="booking-calendar-help">Pilih tanggal permintaanmu. Ketersediaan tetap dikonfirmasi oleh Chii.</small>
                <p id="error-date" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p>
              </div>
              <div class="booking-field"><label id="booking-time-label" for="booking-time">Jam mulai</label><select id="booking-time" name="time" required aria-describedby="hint-time booking-slot-status error-time"><option value="">Pilih tanggal terlebih dahulu</option></select><small id="hint-time">Jam menyesuaikan layanan, durasi, dan tanggal pilihanmu.</small><p id="booking-slot-status" class="booking-slot-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p><button id="booking-slot-retry" class="booking-status-retry text-link" type="button" hidden>Periksa jadwal lagi</button><p id="error-time" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p></div>
            </fieldset>
            <fieldset disabled>
              <legend>Bukti pembayaran</legend>
              <div class="booking-field"><label for="booking-paymentProof">Unggah bukti pembayaran</label><input id="booking-paymentProof" name="paymentProof" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/heic,image/heif,.heic,.heif" required aria-describedby="hint-paymentProof booking-proof-status error-paymentProof" /><small id="hint-paymentProof">JPEG, PNG, atau WebP · maksimal 10 MB. Gambar diperkecil sebelum dikirim.</small><p id="error-paymentProof" class="booking-field-error" hidden></p></div>
              <div class="booking-proof-stage">
              <div id="booking-proof-preview" class="booking-proof-preview" hidden><img id="booking-proof-image" width="320" height="180" alt="Pratinjau bukti pembayaran" /><button id="booking-proof-remove" class="booking-status-retry text-link" type="button">Hapus gambar</button></div>
                <p class="booking-proof-placeholder">Pratinjau bukti pembayaran akan tampil di sini setelah gambar dipilih atau dipulihkan.</p>
              </div>
              <p id="booking-proof-status" class="booking-slot-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Unggah bukti pembayaran untuk melanjutkan.</p>
              <p class="booking-privacy">Bukti hanya dapat dilihat Chii dan dihapus otomatis 30 hari setelah jadwal booking.</p>
            </fieldset>
            <div id="booking-challenge" class="booking-challenge" aria-label="Pemeriksaan keamanan" hidden></div>
            <button id="booking-review" class="button" type="submit" aria-describedby="booking-required-hint booking-submit-status" disabled>Book</button>
            <p id="booking-required-hint" class="booking-privacy">Lengkapi semua kolom dan bukti pembayaran untuk melanjutkan. Nominal mengikuti pilihan DP atau full payment.</p>
            <p id="booking-submit-status" class="booking-submit-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Memeriksa layanan booking…</p>
            <button id="booking-status-retry" class="booking-status-retry text-link" type="button" hidden>Periksa layanan lagi</button>
            <p id="booking-submit-privacy" class="booking-privacy">Dengan menekan Book, kamu menyiapkan permintaan untuk dikirim ke Chii. Kamu tetap perlu menekan Kirim di WhatsApp.</p>
          </form>
          <section id="booking-review-panel" class="booking-review-panel" aria-labelledby="booking-review-title" hidden>
            <h2 id="booking-review-title" tabindex="-1">Permintaan siap dikirim.</h2>
            <p id="booking-review-description">WhatsApp akan dibuka dengan ringkasan booking. Tekan Kirim untuk menghubungi Chii.</p>
            <dl class="booking-summary">
              <div><dt>Nama</dt><dd data-booking-value="name"></dd></div><div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd data-booking-value="whatsapp"></dd></div><div><dt>Desain</dt><dd data-booking-value="design"></dd></div><div><dt>Tanggal</dt><dd data-booking-value="date"></dd></div><div><dt id="booking-duration-summary-label">Waktu</dt><dd data-booking-value="time"></dd></div><div><dt>Harga total</dt><dd data-booking-value="agreedPrice"></dd></div><div><dt id="booking-payment-summary-label">Pembayaran</dt><dd data-booking-value="deposit"></dd></div><div class="booking-balance"><dt>Sisa pembayaran</dt><dd data-booking-value="remainingBalance"></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="booking-transfer-note">Bayar nominal pilihanmu melalui transfer atau QRIS sesuai petunjuk Chii di WhatsApp. Kirim bukti pembayaran di percakapan yang sama untuk diperiksa.</p>
            <a id="booking-whatsapp-link" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">Buka WhatsApp</a>
            <button id="booking-edit" class="booking-edit text-link" type="button">Ubah detail</button>
            <p id="booking-review-privacy" class="booking-privacy">Booking belum dikonfirmasi sampai Chii menyetujui jadwal dan memeriksa pembayaran.</p>
          </section>
        </section>
        <aside class="booking-guidance" aria-labelledby="booking-guidance-title">
          <h2 id="booking-guidance-title">Dari obrolan ke nail date.</h2>
          <ol><li><strong>Konsultasi dulu.</strong><p>Sepakati desain, durasi, dan harga total dengan Chii. Isi nominal DP minimum Rp20.000 atau pilih full payment.</p></li><li><strong>Lengkapi detailmu.</strong><p>Plain, Gel, dan Removal memakai slot 1 jam. Simple Design 1–2 jam dan Full Art 3–5 jam, sesuai konsultasi. Unggah bukti pembayaran sebelum menekan Book.</p></li><li><strong>Konfirmasi melalui WhatsApp.</strong><p>Chii memeriksa pembayaran melalui transfer atau QRIS dan jadwal sebelum mengonfirmasi booking.</p></li></ol>
          <div class="booking-hours"><strong>Jam studio · WIB</strong>{salon.openingHours.map(day => <p>{day.label}<span>{day.opens.replace(':', '.')}–{day.closes.replace(':', '.')}<small>Last book {day.lastBooking}</small></span></p>)}</div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/about#booking-rules">Baca aturan booking →</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>
    <Footer year={new Date().getFullYear()} />
    <script src="../scripts/client.js"></script>
    <script src="../scripts/booking-client.js"></script>
    <script src="../scripts/order-lookup.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
